          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Use Bayes&#39; theorem with the event $T$ = &quot;on time&quot;. Total probability: $P(T)=P(\\text{walk})P(T|\\text{walk})+P(\\text{car})P(T|\\text{car})+P(\\text{bus})P(T|\\text{bus})=0.2(0.90)+0.5(0.97)+0.3(0.93)=0.18+0.485+0.279=0.944$. Then $P(\\text{walk}|T)=\\dfrac{0.2(0.90)}{0.944}=\\dfrac{0.18}{0.944}=0.1907\\approx0.191$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Dùng định lý Bayes với biến cố $T$ = &quot;đúng giờ&quot;. Xác suất toàn phần: $P(T)=0{,}2(0{,}90)+0{,}5(0{,}97)+0{,}3(0{,}93)=0{,}18+0{,}485+0{,}279=0{,}944$. Khi đó $P(\\text{đi bộ}|T)=\\dfrac{0{,}18}{0{,}944}=0{,}1907\\approx0{,}191$.</p></div>"
